    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innertial</strong> invites you to step into a hyper-commodified future, where your actions shape the world around you. In this probability-based walking simulator, the rooms you explore shift and adapt to your behaviour, creating an individualized journey through ever-changing environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to the soothing colors and sounds as all your needs are fullfiled! Use the Setter Cube as your reliable everything companion: set the room's color, reveals interactions, track you status, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this post-language world, where even the simplest routines are gamified, and your daily cycle becomes the puzzle to solve.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innertial</strong> invites you to step into a hyper-commodified future, where your actions shape the world around you. In this probability-based walking simulator, the rooms you explore shift and adapt to your behaviour, creating an individualized journey through ever-changing environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to the soothing colors and sounds as all your needs are fullfiled! Use the Setter Cube as your reliable everything companion: set the room's color, reveals interactions, track you status, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this post-language world, where even the simplest routines are gamified, and your daily cycle becomes the puzzle to solve.</p>",
